<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>WebSocket on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/websocket/</link><description>Recent content in WebSocket on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/websocket/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MiBeeNvr 的子码流体系：让手机看监控不卡不烫</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibeesteward-nvr-sub-stream-quality/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibeesteward-nvr-sub-stream-quality/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;手机上看监控最烦的两件事：发烫、卡顿。多画面监控页一次开四五路，每路都在收高分辨率的主码流，手机一边解码一边收包，电池掉得肉眼可见，画面还一顿一顿。多数人第一反应是换手机或者把 WiFi 切到 5G，其实瓶颈不在网络，在送过来的那一路流本身。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>